KernelSU A32 4.19-port-kit
===========================

Upstream: tiann/KernelSU, tag v0.9.5
Upstream commit: b766b98513b5a7eb33bc1c4a76b5702bf1288f07
Target device: OPPO A32 (PDVM00 / OP4E35), ColorOS V11.1 / Android 11
SoC: Qualcomm SM4250 (Snapdragon 460)   Kernel: 4.19.152-perf+
Firmware: PDVM00_11_C.29

The root source tree of this repository is a byte-for-byte copy of the
upstream v0.9.5 tag. No upstream source file was modified.

